# No Tests in bilirec-web

This repo is verified by running the app, not by unit tests. Do not write tests.

- Do not create `*.test.ts`, `*.test.tsx`, `*.spec.ts`, `__tests__/`, or similar test files.
- Do not add test runners or testing devDependencies (vitest, jest, @testing-library, playwright, …) to `package.json`.
- Do not add `test` / `vitest` scripts.
- Do not restructure production code to be "testable" or add exports only for tests.

If a change feels unsafe without tests, say so and ask the user first instead of writing them.
